-- statement:
--   **The Lemma 13 cost in the `RowHyp` form.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFRBridge`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFR.ceil_bnd_le {Kc : ℝ} (hKc : 0 < Kc) {K f n r Z : ℕ} (hK : 1 ≤ K) (hf : 1 ≤ f)
--       (hfZ : f ≤ Z) (hKZ : 80 * Z * (Z + 2) ≤ 2 ^ K) (hn : 1 ≤ n)
--       (hZ : zsz ((16 * (n * r) : ℕ) : ℤ) ≤ Z) (w : ℕ) :
--       (⌈bnd Kc K f n r w⌉₊ : ℝ) ≤ (Kc * (K + 2) + 1) * n *
--         ((r : ℝ) * (w + 1) * ((f : ℝ) + 1) ^ τ50 + (PsiR r Z w : ℝ))
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** KFR: the bridge `Lem13ILP iprog → RowHyp … τ50`
--
--   * `PsiR r Z w = 2 (Z + zsz (w+1) + 2)^3 + ⌊r (w+1) zsz (w+1) / (Z+2)⌋ + 2` (monotone, `≥ Z+2`).
--   * `ceil_bnd_le`: when `80 Z (Z+2) ≤ 2^K` and `f ≤ Z`, the Lemma 13 cost `⌈bnd⌉` is at most
--     `(Kc (K+2) + 1) · n · (r (w+1) (f+1)^τ50 + PsiR r Z w)`.  The guard term
--     `min 1 (80 (f-1) 2^{-K})` is at most `1/(Z+2)`, which absorbs the `zsz` factors of the
--     correction cost into `O(r (w+1))` plus `r (w+1) zsz(w+1)/(Z+2)` (inside `PsiR`).
--   * **`rowHyp_of_lem13`**: `Lem13ILP iprog → ∃ Kc > 0, ∀ K m r Z, 6 ≤ K → 3 ≤ m → 1 ≤ r →
--     80 Z (Z+2) ≤ 2^K → RowHyp Isym iprog K m r Z (PsiR r Z) (Kc (K+2) + 1) τ50`.
